  ['Is Axis-Y glow serum good for melasma or stubborn hyperpigmentation?', 'It is a mild serum, so I would not expect it to treat stubborn pigmentation or melasma by itself. Dermatologists can prescribe stronger treatments and combine them safely, so see one if over-the-counter products do not give you the result you want.'],
  ['Is it safe during pregnancy?', 'I have not researched this, and this article is not medical advice. If you are pregnant or breastfeeding, ask your doctor or dermatologist before starting any new serum.'],
